<Layout title="Privacy · HQD Aggregate catalogue"><section class="container page-heading"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Privacy</p><h1>Privacy<span>.</span></h1></section><article class="container prose"><h2>Browser-local product selection</h2><p>The shortlist is saved in this browser’s local storage. It is not connected to an account and is not uploaded by this catalogue. Use “Clear shortlist” to remove the saved selection.</p><h2>Contact enquiries</h2><p>When you select “Send enquiry”, this website submits the name, email address, company, phone number, product selections, machine information and message you choose to provide. Cloudflare processes the request, and FormSubmit delivers the enquiry to lisa@hqd-spindlemotor.com. HQD uses these details to respond to your request. Your email address is included as Reply-To so HQD can reply directly.</p><p>The website does not save enquiry contents in its own database or application logs. Cloudflare processes connection information, including your IP address, to operate the website. A hashed identifier is cached briefly to limit repeated submissions. FormSubmit documents a submission archive retained for 30 days; delivered messages may also remain in HQD’s mailbox. See the <a href="https://formsubmit.co/documentation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit documentation</a> for details. Please include only information needed to discuss your machining requirement.</p><h2>Images and external links</h2><p>Product images are served with this website. HQD source links open the original manufacturer website. External websites and email providers have their own privacy practices. This catalogue does not add advertising or analytics trackers.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For product enquiries or a request about your submitted information, contact <a href="mailto:lisa@hqd-spindlemotor.com">lisa@hqd-spindlemotor.com</a>.</p></article></Layout>
